<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A5.SS4" title="In Appendix E More Implementation Details and Experiments ‣ StableGuard: Towards Unified Copyright Protection and Tamper Localization in Latent Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E.4 </span>Forensic Accuracy under Varying Tampering Ratios</span></a></li>
